      "AUTUMN: I don't feel well.\nSKYLAR: Come on. Let's go. Please...",
      "CENTER DIRECTOR: Another cold day isn't it?\nAUTUMN: Yeah.\nCENTER DIRECTOR: We turned up the heat this morning, but no matter what we do, there's always a chill. My name is Beth by the way. Autumn?\nAUTUMN: Hi.",
      "CENTER DIRECTOR: Come on in. Make yourself at home.\nAUTUMN: Thanks.\nCENTER DIRECTOR: We can sit here and talk for a minute.\nCENTER DIRECTOR: Can you tell me a little about the symptoms that brought you in today?",
      "CENTER DIRECTOR: You can just go in here. I’ll be waiting right outside.\nAUTUMN: I’m finished.\nAUTUMN: Is that from the supermarket?\nCENTER DIRECTOR: Yes. Yes, it is.",
      "AUTUMN: 10, 20, 30, 40.\nSKYLAR: 10, 20, 30, 40.\nAUTUMN: Wait, not at the same time. You’ll fuck me up.\nSKYLAR: Sorry."
